The {{Term/Store|Climber's Bandanna|Climber's Bandannas|Series, BotW, TotK, AoC}} is a recurring [[Item]] in {{TLoZ Series}}.{{Exp Game|BotW, TotK, AoC}}<ref name="BotW Inventory"/><ref name="TotK Inventory"/><ref name="AoC Allies"/>

==Location and Uses==
==={{BotW|-}}===
{{Descriptions BotW}}
The Climber's Bandanna is a piece of [[Armor]] located in the [[Ree Dahee Shrine]] at [[Dueling Peaks]]. After obtaining it, [[Granté]] will begin selling the piece of Armor for 4,000 [[Rupee]]s. It is infused with ancient technology, despite what its plain appearance would suggest.<ref name="BotW Inventory"/> When worn, it provides one level of [[Climb Speed Up]]. The Climber's Bandanna can be [[Enhancing|Enhanced]] by [[Great Fairy|Great Fairies]] and can be [[Hateno Dye|Dye]]d at the [[Kochi Dye Shop]]. The Climber's Bandanna, alongside the [[Climbing Gear]] and [[Climbing Boots]], compose the [[Climbing Set]]. When each piece of the Set has been Upgraded at least two times by a Great Fairy and the full Set is worn, it provides a [[Climb Jump Stamina Up]] [[Set Bonus]].

